DTSTART:20261021T000000Z
DTEND:20261021T020000Z
SUMMARY:Italian Songbook with Scanzonati: Stefano Marchese and Andrea Pejro
 lo at Berklee Performance Center
LOCATION:136 Massachusetts Ave\, Boston\, MA 02115
DESCRIPTION:Scanzonati is a decade-running project led by Berklee faculty v
 ocalist Stefano Marchese and bassist-arranger Andrea Pejrolo that reimagin
 es Italian and Mediterranean songwriting through contemporary jazz harmony
  and improvisation. Tickets: https://www.berklee.edu/BPC
CATEGORIES:jazz
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
