DTSTART:20261021T230000Z
DTEND:20261022T010000Z
SUMMARY:Jerron Paxton and Dennis Lichtman at Rockport Music
LOCATION:37 Main St\, Rockport\, MA 01966
DESCRIPTION:Acoustic blues/old-time duo pairing multi-instrumentalist Jerro
 n "Blind Boy" Paxton (banjo\, fiddle\, piano\, guitar\; released on Smiths
 onian Folkways and Analogue Productions\, featured in the documentary 'The
  American Epic Sessions') with NYC clarinetist/multi-instrumentalist Denni
 s Lichtman (Carnegie Hall performer\, credits on HBO's Succession and The 
 Plot Against America). Both are established touring musicians in the tradi
 tional jazz/blues scene. Tickets: https://tickets.rockportmusic.org/events
CATEGORIES:blues
END:VEVENT
